               "karmaṇaiveti :– karmaṇaiva hi yasmāt pūrve kṣatriyāḥ vidvāṃsaḥ, saṃsiddhiṃ mokṣaṃ, gantum, āsthitāḥ pravṛttāḥ. ke? janakādayaḥ janakāśvapatiprabhṛtayaḥ yadi te prāptasamyagdarśanāḥ, tat lokasaṅgrahārthaṃ prārabdhakarmatvāt karmaṇā sahaiva, asannyasyaiva karma, saṃsiddhim āsthitāḥ ityarthaḥ, atha aprāptasamyag darśanāḥ janakādayaḥ tadā karmaṇā, sattvasaṃśuddhi sādhanabhūtena krameṇa saṃsiddhim āsthitāḥ iti vyākhyeyaḥ ślokaḥ.",
